{
 "about": "Every OBP-API call Sentinel makes: verb, path (OBP placeholders in capitals), the source file and the text that makes the call (needles), and the response fields the code reads. Paths whose version comes from a setting or a constant carry that version's default, and version_from names the text in the source that sets it. The log cache and Telemetry an app (API Explorer II, the API Manager, the Portal, Cohort, OBP-OIDC) serves at its own monitoring path are not OBP-API calls and are not listed, nor are the OIDC discovery and token requests, which go to the OIDC provider. tests/test_obp_contract.py checks this list against the source and against snapshot.json, which obp-api-contract/snapshot.py writes from an OBP-API's resource docs.",
